            "id": "4968196",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/attachment/image/351fbb8c8827d751363174ad201d012e.png?io=w640\" width=\"100%\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">Seeking Alpha</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b italic\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/77-investment-news-quiz-friday-nov-13-2026-11-13\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <h2> </h2> <p>Wall Street ended the trading week higher, despite persistent concerns over inflation and the interest-rate outlook, as investors also digested the news of Jensen Huang’s resignation as Nvidia’s chief executive officer.<br/><br/>Nvidia (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVDA\" title=\"NVIDIA Corporation\">NVDA</a>) shares remained under pressure all week after the company announced that Chief Executive Officer Jensen Huang has <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4671444-nvidia-drops-into-deep-oversold-territory-as-ceo-jensen-huang-resigns&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1794748078768000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ltOFejq0rHcruwpqSTDYd\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4671444-nvidia-drops-into-deep-oversold-territory-as-ceo-jensen-huang-resigns\" target=\"_blank\">resigned</a> effective immediately.</p> <p>U.S. inflation remained stubbornly elevated in October, with <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4669735-october-cpi-doesnt-cool-quite-as-much-as-consensus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1794748078768000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_Lyn66n519_kVGWmcgyAJ\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4669735-october-cpi-doesnt-cool-quite-as-much-as-consensus\" target=\"_blank\">CPI</a> rising 0.4% month over month, exceeding economists’ expectations of a 0.3% increase.</p> <p>The hotter-than-expected inflation data puts a <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4669833-a-50-basis-point-december-rate-hike-now-looks-to-be-on-the-table-after-cpi-data&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1794748078768000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1C53Mvl3NfU0dHHaIK_wCT\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4669833-a-50-basis-point-december-rate-hike-now-looks-to-be-on-the-table-after-cpi-data\" target=\"_blank\">50-basis-point</a> rate hike back in consideration for December, while a 25-basis-point increase now appears largely priced in.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) added +2%, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) popped +2.5%, while the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) climbed +2.2%. Read a preview of next week's major events in Seeking Alpha's <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4672450-catalyst-watch-anthropic-ipo-nvidia-shockwaves-nike-event-and-gta-6-arrives&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1794748078768000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WOvdHNq_11MyOEhWUE9Ax\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4672450-catalyst-watch-anthropic-ipo-nvidia-shockwaves-nike-event-and-gta-6-arrives\" target=\"_blank\">Catalyst Watch</a>.</p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4672276-a-global-gas-crunch-is-squeezing-the-world-but-not-the-us\">Price gap</a></h2> <p>Europe and Asia have borne the brunt of the Iran war-driven surge in natural gas prices, while the U.S. has largely been shielded from it. U.S. buyers pay around $3 per MMBtu for natural gas. But European and Asian consumers are currently paying a little over $30 per MMBtu. What's behind this wide price gap? <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4672276-a-global-gas-crunch-is-squeezing-the-world-but-not-the-us\"><span class=\"b\">Read more.</span></a></p> <h2>Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</h2> <p>Here's Why <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MPLX\" title=\"MPLX LP Common Units\">MPLX</a> Is A Good Fit <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966951-mplx-good-fit-for-income-investors\">For Income Investors</a>.<br/><br/>Upgrading <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BOIL\" title=\"ProShares Ultra Bloomberg Natural Gas ETF\">BOIL</a> To Strong Buy With <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4967263-upgrading-boil-to-strong-buy-with-caution-in-november-2026-rating-upgrade\">Caution In November</a>.<br/><br/>Bullish On American Express (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AXP\" title=\"American Express Company\">AXP</a>) - <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966732-american-express-deserves-more-credit-rating-upgrade\">Deserves More Credit</a>.<br/><br/>BYD (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BYDDF\" title=\"BYD Company Limited\">BYDDF</a>): Why Isn't The Market <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966714-byd-the-world-is-buying-its-cars-but-the-market-isnt-buying-its-stock-upgrade\">Buying This Stock?</a><br/><br/>Apple (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AAPL\" title=\"Apple Inc.\">AAPL</a>) Deserves <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COST\">Costco's</a> Multiple, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4967359-apple-deserves-costcos-multiple-rating-upgrade\">Upgrade To Hold</a>.<br/><br/>I've <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4967400-ive-come-to-terms-with-teslas-unmeritocratic-overvaluation-rating-downgrade\">Come To Terms With</a> Tesla's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TSLA\" title=\"Tesla, Inc.\">TSLA</a>) Overvaluation.<br/> <br/>Nvidia (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVDA\" title=\"NVIDIA Corporation\">NVDA</a>): Taking Profit After <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4967205-nvidia-taking-profit-after-the-jensen-huang-resignation-rating-downgrade\">Jensen Huang's Exit</a>.<br/><br/>Medical Properties (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MPT\" title=\"Medical Properties Trust, Inc.\">MPT</a>): I Was Wrong, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4965253-medical-properties-trust-i-was-wrong-the-market-is-not-rating-downgrade\">The Market Is Not</a>.<br/><br/>Sell Plug Power (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PLUG\" title=\"Plug Power Inc.\">PLUG</a>): On Higher <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966866-plug-power-sell-on-increased-risk-of-near-term-dilution-rating-downgrade\">Near-Term Dilution Risk</a>.<br/><br/>This Fund's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/XFLT\" title=\"XAI Floating Rate &amp; Alternative Income Trust\">XFLT</a>) Shareholders Are <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966016-xflt-shareholders-are-desperate-to-get-out\">Desperate To Get Out</a>.</p> <h2>Weekly Movement</h2> <p><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span> to 52,348. S&amp;P 500 <span class=\"green\">+2.5%</span> to 7,562. Nasdaq <span class=\"green\">+2.3%</span> to 25,136. Russell 2000 <span class=\"green\">+1.4%</span> to 2,791. CBOE Volatility Index <span class=\"red\">-24.7%</span> to 19.30.</p> <p><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples <span class=\"green\">+2.5%</span>. Utilities <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span>. Financials <span class=\"green\">+2.7%</span>. Telecom <span class=\"green\">+3.7%</span>. Healthcare <span class=\"green\">+2.2%</span>. Industrials <span class=\"green\">+3.8%</span>. Information Technology <span class=\"green\">+3.4%</span>. Materials <span class=\"green\">+0.5%</span>. Energy <span class=\"green\">+5.4%</span>. Consumer Discretionary <span class=\"green\">+2%</span>. Real Estate <span class=\"green\">+0.8%</span>.</p> <p><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span> to 10,903. France <span class=\"green\">+2.8%</span> to 8,369. Germany <span class=\"green\">+3.6%</span> to 26,750. Japan <span class=\"green\">+6.5%</span> to 61,142. China <span class=\"red\">-0.4%</span> to 3,634. Hong Kong <span class=\"red\">-3.5%</span> to 23,638. India <span class=\"green\">+0.7%</span> to 81,592.</p> <p><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI <span class=\"red\">-2.1%</span> to $88.92/bbl. Gold <span class=\"red\">-4.5%</span> to $3,884.8/oz. Natural Gas <span class=\"green\">+8.1%</span> to 3.242. Ten-Year Bond Yield +26 bps to 5.14%.</p> <p><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD ~<span class=\"red\">-1.1%</span>. USD/JPY ~<span class=\"green\">+0.8%</span>. GBP/USD ~<span class=\"red\">-1%</span>. Bitcoin ~<span class=\"red\">-9%</span>. Litecoin ~<span class=\"red\">-5.4%</span>. Ethereum ~<span class=\"red\">-14%</span>. XRP ~<span class=\"red\">-13%</span>.</p> <p><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers<br/></strong>AMD (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMD\" title=\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.\">AMD</a>) <span class=\"green\">+18.9%</span> Broadcom (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AVGO\" title=\"Broadcom Inc.\">AVGO</a>) <span class=\"green\">+18.2%</span> Charter Communications (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CHTR\" title=\"Charter Communications, Inc.\">CHTR</a>) <span class=\"green\">+17.2%</span> Monolithic Power (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MPWR\" title=\"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc.\">MPWR</a>) <span class=\"green\">+16.8%</span> Arista Networks (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANET\" title=\"Arista Networks, Inc.\">ANET</a>) <span class=\"green\">+15.5%<br/><br/></span><span class=\"b\">Top S&amp;P 500 Losers<br/></span>First Solar (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FSLR\" title=\"First Solar, Inc.\">FSLR</a>) <span class=\"red\">-14.8%</span> Nvidia (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVDA\" title=\"NVIDIA Corporation\">NVDA</a>) <span class=\"red\">-12.8%</span> Moderna (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MRNA\" title=\"Moderna, Inc.\">MRNA</a>) <span class=\"red\">-12.1%</span> DaVita (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DVA\" title=\"DaVita Inc.\">DVA</a>) <span class=\"red\">-8.8%</span> NVR (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVR\" title=\"NVR, Inc.\">NVR</a>) <span class=\"red\">-7.1%</span></p> <p><em>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4964579-what-moved-markets-this-week\">to the comments section.</a></em></p> </div></body></html>",
