            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Traffic jam on a snow cowered road in winter time. A lot of snow cowered cars in a row.\" data-id=\"2247293762\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1025\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247293762/image_2247293762.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Scharfsinn86/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p>Growing up in the North, I quickly learned of snow's impact on my family's life. You see, snow could arrive as a light dusting on the surface of the earth, or it could come in a torrent, adding inches upon</p></body></html>",
